      "name": "index.ts",
      "filePath": "packages/opencode/src/git/index.ts",
      "summary": "Git service wrapping the git CLI with hardened -c config overrides, streaming stdout collection with byte caps and truncation flags, and operations for branch, merge-base, status, diff, stats, patch (tracked, untracked, or all), and patch application.",
      "tags": ["service", "git", "effect", "cli-wrapper"],
      "complexity": "complex",
      "languageNotes": "Every invocation injects config overrides (autocrlf/fsmonitor/quotepath off, longpaths/symlinks on) to normalize behavior across environments; porcelain output is parsed from NUL-separated fields."
