      "type": "file",
      "name": "index.ts",
      "filePath": "packages/opencode/src/installation/index.ts",
      "summary": "Installation service: detects the install method (curl, npm, brew, scoop, choco, ...), queries the latest release version from the matching registry APIs, compares it with the running version, and performs self-upgrade by re-running the original installer; emits installation update bus events.",
      "tags": ["service", "updater", "installation", "versioning"],
      "complexity": "complex",
      "languageNotes": "Each install method has its own version-source schema (GitHubRelease, NpmPackage, BrewFormula, ChocoPackage, ScoopManifest) decoded via Effect Schema; HTTP requests run through a transient-read-retry filter."
