      "name": "AGENTS.md",
      "filePath": "packages/opencode/src/lsp/AGENTS.md",
      "summary": "Module notes for the LSP subsystem documenting lifecycle invariants and pitfalls: unbounded per-client diagnostic maps, the dead didClose notification handler, LRU bounds inside notify.open, tsserver memory caps via maxTsServerMemory, broken-server blacklisting, and map-bounding off-by-one conventions.",
      "tags": ["documentation", "lsp", "memory-management", "invariants"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:packages/opencode/src/lsp/client.ts",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "client.ts",
      "filePath": "packages/opencode/src/lsp/client.ts",
      "summary": "LSP client factory: builds a JSON-RPC connection over a spawned server process, performs the initialize handshake with capability negotiation, tracks open documents (didOpen/didChange), merges push and pull diagnostics into bounded per-file maps with LRU eviction, and exposes wait-for-diagnostics with timeouts plus shutdown cleanup.",
      "tags": ["lsp", "client", "diagnostics", "json-rpc"],
      "complexity": "complex",
      "languageNotes": "Diagnostics flow through two paths — server-pushed publishDiagnostics and client-pulled textDocument/diagnostic — merged and deduped; MAX_DIAGNOSTICS=200 caps map growth using a >= MAX eviction that lands exactly on the bound."
    },
    {
      "id": "function:packages/opencode/src/lsp/client.ts:dedupeDiagnostics",
